OUTED\",\"subtype\":\"releases\",\"text\":\"The Qatar Financial Markets Authority (QFMA) approved the country's first two spot bitcoin exchange-traded funds on Wednesday, clearing products from two local asset managers to list on the Qatar Stock Exchange (QSE), according to a notice published by the regulator. The QFMA had not included crypto funds in its published product plans, so the approval came earlier than market participants expected. The funds will hold bitcoin directly and begin trading on November 26. The issuers said they plan to seed the funds with about 1,600 BTC bought on the spot market before launch. A QFMA spokesperson confirmed the approval to The Block.\",\"title\":\"Qatar Financial Markets Authority approves first spot bitcoin ETFs for QSE listing; 1,600 BTC seed\",\"url\":\"https://www.theblock.co/news/regulation/2026-10-21-qatar-qfma-approves-first-spot-bitcoin-etfs-qse-421410\"},\"message\":{\"item_id\":\"ITM-01M5EKPSE8YVTW0BC8C7PD51Q1\",\"kind\":\"NEW_ITEM\"}}", "type": "text"}], "type": "user.message"}, "last_payload": {"item_id": "ITM-01M5EKPSE8YVTW0BC8C7PD51Q1", "kind": "NEW_ITEM"}, "messages": ["a22c08c989bc2ac8437b676baf4079a260b754e67fc87ebc009806d66d00f565"], "missing_fields": {}, "model_id": "gpt-6.1-sol", "model_id_basis": "RESOLVED_SESSION_AGENT", "native_execution_receipts": {"sevt_-mRZewrgCw_E337vWZp42": {"execution_id": "sevt_req_f1b1fc204bdcb8239d545719722988ebb4366476ae90b8991c351f58328bc0ff_0", "id": "sevt_-mRZewrgCw_E337vWZp42", "processed_at": "2026-10-21T06:53:44.917Z", "stop_reason": {"event_ids": ["call_02a737a96ba84e71a5483b754cfd9506|fc_01405e7b814cf5a1016ad861766e0c8191ba8570a21541de7e"], "type": "requires_action"}, "type": "session.status_idle"}, "sevt_5jI8tiN4IkQlCSr-GEcG6": {"execution_id": "sevt_req_631262880ad49c0cff4e9834302ecd066046cb0ebf6adee260fb0945c5e916bb_0", "id": "sevt_5jI8tiN4IkQlCSr-GEcG6", "processed_at": "2026-10-21T06:52:58.524Z", "type": "session.status_running"}, "sevt_8hHuZ33jyFbMUG7Nidrni": {"ex